  "body": "This PR adds Back/forward cache NotRestoredReasons interface, adds it to document state, and sets the appropriate value. Explainer is [here](https://github.com/WICG/bfcache-not-restored-reason/blob/main/NotRestoredReason.md).\r\n\r\n(Sorry for lots of unnecessary commits - I used VSCode for editing the source file, and it automatically added and removed parts of the file due to the large size and messed up rebase. Later I switched to vim and didn't have the problem.)\r\n\r\n- [x] At least two implementers are interested (and none opposed):\r\n   * Gecko: https://github.com/mozilla/standards-positions/issues/766 (defer -> once explainer and spec is ready, will flip to positive). https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/9360#pullrequestreview-1878341603\r\n   * WebKit: https://github.com/WebKit/standards-positions/issues/154 (pending)\r\n- [x] [Tests](https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt) are written and can be reviewed and commented upon at:\r\n   * Under PerformanceTimeline WPT: https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/tree/master/performance-timeline/not-restored-reasons\r\n- [x] [Implementation bugs](https://github.com/whatwg/meta/blob/main/MAINTAINERS.md#handling-pull-requests) are filed:\r\n   * Chromium: [crbug.com/c/1326344](https://bugs.chromium.org/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=1326344)\r\n   * Gecko: https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1962250\r\n   * WebKit: https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=291971\r\n\r\nPlease take a look @rakina @domenic @fergald @smaug----\r\n\r\n\r\n<!--\r\n    This comment and the below content is programmatically generated.\r\n    You may add a comma-separated list of anchors you'd like a\r\n    direct link to below (e.g. #idl-serializers, #idl-sequence):\r\n\r\n    Don't remove this comment or modify anything below this line.\r\n    If you don't want a preview generated for this pull request,\r\n    just replace the whole of this comment's content by \"no preview\"\r\n    and remove what's below.\r\n-->\r\n